  "description": "Min Ha-Ri, who found dating predictable and boring, instantly falls for Seo Do-Ha, whom she meets by chance one day. Although she had vowed never to date again, he becomes the perfect boyfriend, enough to shatter even that promise. However, as they spend more time together, she begins to feel something unsettling. It feels as though Seo Do-Ha is hiding a secret…\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=851709), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14304363)",
